# Active GP–MCMC with POD Surrogates

Adaptive Metropolis–Hastings with an actively learned Gaussian process surrogate for time-dependent forward models.

The sampler reduces expensive forward evaluations by combining POD-based model reduction, GP emulation with uncertainty quantification, and adaptive MCMC in a whitened parameter space, while preserving a surrogate-consistent target distribution.

